  "_approach": "A four-bar 'live percussionist' phrase: wide velocity movement everywhere, the shaker drops out for half of bar 3 (IQSounds' favourite mute) while a tambourine covers, congas grow into a short roll at the end of bar 4, rim backbeat throughout. Built by subtraction, as Orphiq recommends. Ref: Black Coffee feat. Bucie 'Superman' (2010), Culoe De Song 'The Bright Forest' (2010). (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
